# PC card team-lines (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 10.2, TMODE-15): arm mlw (TMODE-15 wide lines, ablation tmlinesw: LINES_K 0.6, LINES_HALF 0.45), all 46 teams against master (the aa build). Template: tnprep writes work/team-lines-mlw.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
